dm-user Tests
=============
Tests for dm-user.

I'm just knocking off selftests/futex here.  There's a C helper in
harness/harness.c that does the DM ioctl, but otherwise everything's
essentially the same.

Quick Start
-----------
# make
# ./run.sh

Slow Start
----------
These tests use `dmsetup` to manage device mapper nodes, which is part of lvm2.
